 "recap": [
  "Tagalog has no word for brown things: say kulay kapé or kulay tsokoláte. Kayumanggí is for skin and race only.",
  "Basic colors: pulá, asúl/bugháw, diláw, bérde/luntían, ube, kulay kahél, itím, putî, lila, rósas, abó.",
  "Dark or bright: repeat the color with na or -ng: asúl na asúl, bérdeng-bérde, puláng-pulá.",
  "Light or pale: add murá: asúl na murá, muráng bérde, diláw na murá.",
  "Shades: ma- + repeated root (mapúla-púla; mang- for asúl) or root + -an (pulahán, dilawán).",
  "Colors from materials: bérdeng mansánas, bérdeng lúmot, gintô/ginintuán, pilak/pinilakan."
 ]
